Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: add configurable memory metacognition framework

Introduces opt-in extension points for compact memory indexing,
recall query expansion, and memory-aware preflight checks.

All behavior is disabled by default and controlled via policy.

- agent/memory_metacognition.py: framework interfaces + policy loader
- agent/memory_policy.default.yaml: conservative default (all disabled)
- agent/prompt_builder.py: thin wrappers for index/query expansion
- run_agent.py: optional preflight gate + query expansion hooks
- tests/test_memory_metacognition_upstream.py: 28 tests, all passing
