Date: Sat, 9 May 2026 21:06:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: add structured preflight argument checks

Adds five new check types that validate tool arguments directly,
complementing the existing memory recall checks:

- field_required: field must exist
- field_equals: field must equal value
- field_not_equals: field must NOT equal value
- field_contains: field must contain substring
- field_not_contains: field must NOT contain substring

Also:
- trigger_patterns now match both arg keys and values
- Multiple rules per tool supported without override
- Backward compatible: old check types still work as memory recall
- 15 new upstream tests (43 total)
- Updated default policy with generic structured check examples
